# GitHub rejects any file over 100MB, and GitHub Pages will not serve one.
# Source presentation decks embed video and animated GIFs and blow past that
# limit (Final_Presentation_Specifix.pptx was 183MB), so keep them out of the
# repo and host them externally. Export slides to JPG for the site instead.
# A genuinely small deck can still be added on purpose with: git add -f file.pptx
*.pptx
*.pptm
*.ppt

# Raw video — same reason. Link to a host that streams it.
*.mp4
*.mov
*.avi
*.mkv

# Archives
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.7z
*.rar

# OS and editor cruft
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*~
.vscode/
.idea/

